# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for mggraph-intune-samples (PowerShell / Microsoft Graph samples)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Operating system artifacts
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Editors / IDEs
.vs/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*~

# Build / packaging output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Oo]utput/
publish/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# Test / coverage results
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage/

# PowerShell secrets / credential material — never commit these
*.pfx
*.cer
*.key
*.pem
secrets.ps1
*.secrets.ps1
*.Credential.xml

# Exported tenant/config data produced by the *_Export.ps1 sample scripts.
# These can contain organization-specific data — keep them out of source control.
# (Add specific export output paths here as needed; broad *.json is intentionally
#  NOT ignored because some samples ship legitimate .json assets.)
Export/
Exports/
_exported/
